# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# amd-pstate (active/EPP mode, governor powersave): near-full boost when busy,
# low clocks at idle, instead of whatever EPP the firmware leaves. No-op
# without cpufreq (QEMU).
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="cpu", TEST=="cpufreq/energy_performance_preference", \
  ATTR{cpufreq/energy_performance_preference}="balance_performance"
